  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you aid in a technique, you may also perform it yourself.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Knowledge of at least one technique.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When multiple characters work together to perform a multi-character technique and all of them possess this feat, they may choose to increase the technique’s complexity by 3. If they do, every character who worked together to initiate the technique may perform the technique’s action (for example, each member would charge when using Fire Tackle).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/techniques#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
